**/.impeccable/hook.pending.json
# Critique snapshots are per-run and hold absolute paths; ignore.md is shared.
.impeccable/critique/*
!.impeccable/critique/ignore.md

# Personal Claude Code notes and UI screenshots
CLAUDE.local.md
.ui-shots/
